      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/28/1/312/1",
      "text": [
        ": حدثنا سعد بن عبد الله، عن يعقوب بن يزيد، عن محمد ابن أبي عمير، عن بعض أصحابه، عن أبي عبد الله عليه السلام قال: الكلالة ما لم يكن والد ولا ولد."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.basel-kadem": [
          "1.\tWe were told by my father, may Allah grant him mercy, that he said: We were told by Sa’d bin Abdullah, from Ya’qoub bin Yazid, from Muhammed ibn Abi ‘Umayr, from some of his companions, from Abu Abdillah, peace be upon him, that he said: The kalala is when there is no parent nor child (to someone)."
        ]
      }
